            },
            {
              "tab_title": "What if I have multiple locations?",
              "tab_content": "We manage all your locations from a single dashboard. Each location gets its own GBP, citation set, and review system. Pricing scales with locations, not linearly \u2014 we offer 20-30% volume discount for multi-location businesses.",
