            },
            {
              "tab_title": "Can I do this myself?",
              "tab_content": "You can. Local SEO is 40-80 hours of work per month, ongoing \u2014 citations, reviews, content, links, GBP posts. Most business owners hire us because their time is better spent on their business. We'll happily share our checklist if you want to try.",
